<title>TURKEY: Turk Tupras sells 30,000 T HVGO to Vitol at +$9.01.</title>
<headline>Turk Tupras sells 30,000 T HVGO to Vitol at +$9.01.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery, Tupras, said it awarded Dutch trader Vitol with its 30,000-tonne heavy vacuum gas oil export tender at a premium of plus $9.01 per tonne with shipment on June 20-25.</p>
<p>Tupras put out the tender on June 2, a company statement said.</p>
<p>--Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
